{
  "tool": "horizun_plan_reinforcement",
  "title": {
    "en": "Plan the reinforcement of every member by its Mark",
    "es": "Planificar el refuerzo de cada elemento por su Marca"
  },
  "about": {
    "en": "Read-only. Each section rule selects the members carrying that Mark, measures each one's frame off its own solid and expands into ordinary rules named <id>#h<element>#<layer> - shown here before anything is built. A member that is not a rectangular prism, or whose cover cannot be read, is refused by name. Bar types and hooks must exist in the model with these names; replace them with your project's.",
    "es": "Solo lectura. Cada section rule selecciona los elementos con esa Marca, mide el marco de cada uno sobre su propio sólido y se expande en reglas normales llamadas <id>#h<elemento>#<capa>, visibles aquí antes de construir nada. Un elemento que no es prisma rectangular, o cuyo recubrimiento no se puede leer, se rechaza por nombre. Los tipos de barra y ganchos deben existir en el modelo con estos nombres; reemplácelos por los de su proyecto."
  },
  "next": "03-apply-reinforcement.json",
